# nexora-action-code: get_clock
Value TIME (\d+:\d+:\d+)
Value TIMEZONE (\S+)
Value DAY_OF_WEEK (\w+)
Value MONTH (\w+)
Value DAY (\d+)
Value YEAR (\d{4})

Start
  ^.*#\s*show\s+ -> Next
  ^${TIME}\s+${TIMEZONE}\s+${DAY_OF_WEEK},\s+${MONTH}\s+${DAY},\s+${YEAR} -> Record
  ^${TIME}\s+${TIMEZONE}\s+${DAY_OF_WEEK}\s+${MONTH}\s+${DAY}\s+${YEAR} -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Next
